#. お主にも何か考えがあるのだろうが…
#. 我には理解できん。
msgctxt "0001 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Maybe you have some idea, but...I don't understand at\n"
"all."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかに議論の矛盾が隠されているはずだ！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there statement somewhere!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 僕の発言とその証拠…
#. 何か矛盾している点でもあるのだろうか？
msgctxt "0003 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"You think you have some proof that contradicts what I\n"
"said...?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかに議論の矛盾が隠されているはずだ！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there statement somewhere!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ほうほう、なるほど。
#. それはつまり…って全然わかんねーぞ！
msgctxt "0005 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Hmm, yes, I see. So what you're saying is...I have\n"
"absolutely no idea!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度、よく考えてみるんだ。
#. どこかに議論の矛盾が隠されているはずだ！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to think about it one more time. There must be\n"
"a contradiction in there statement somewhere!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや…不二咲さんを殺した凶器は、
#. 更衣室にあった物のはずだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No...the weapon that was used to kill Chihiro must\n"
"have been in the locker room...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>凶器は現場にあったはずだ。
#. 血痕が付着していた例の物…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The weapon had to be at the scene of the crime. There\n"
"was something with a bloodstain on it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
